  "description": "Flat A (Ground Floor): \nThe right-hand wing wall is to be set back, and a new window introduced. This maintains the rhythm of the front facade while improving internal light. \nExisting windows and sliding doors are to be replaced with traditional timber French doors. This upgrade improves the flat's aesthetic link to the private rear garden.\n\n\nFlat B (First Floor):\nA right-hand side extension featuring a single-pitch glazed roof (partially tiled) to maximise natural light while maintaining privacy.\nThe extension incorporates front and rear terraces. These are accessed via three new timber French doors (one at the front, two at the rear).\nAn additional side window is included to ensure the new space is well-ventilated and bright.",
